cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "rule30-vdf: a verifiable delay function on the Rule 30 cellular automaton with STARK proofs"
abstract: >-
  A Rust implementation of a verifiable delay function whose sequential work
  is the Rule 30 cellular automaton on a periodic ring. A STARK proof,
  generated and verified with Winterfell, attests that the output follows from
  the input. Unaudited research prototype.
authors:
